Title: NJ OAG Law Enforcement Officer Diversity data package
Version: 1.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Tor", "Gunston", , "tor.gunston@protonmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This is cleaned-up version of the NJ OAG Law Enforcement Officer 
  Diversity database available from https://www.njoag.gov/policerecruiting/:
  agencies and their hiring and promotion practices, and counts of officers and
  applicants by demographics, for 2021 onward.
